d platform based on the HANA database, extended lifetime of hardware, continued high gross margin from Qualtrics, and also benefits from restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/21/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2019 Q3","e":"sap","d":"2019-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"The increase of the services margin mainly results from a strong revenue performance paired with the successful execution of operational excellence measures and restructuring benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/21/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2019 Q3","e":"sap","d":"2019-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"We reiterate our 2019 outlook with great confidence and we are on track to reach our mid-term ambitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/21/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2019 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Morgan","x":"As an intelligent enterprise running S/4HANA, Ariba and Digital Supply Chain, Ford is turning insight into action in real-time, streamlining global finance purchasing processes and massively simplifying their overall IT landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2019 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"We achieved our rate acquisitions at the expenses from the restructuring program that we had announced a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q1","e":"sap","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Klein","x":"With our just completed restructuring program, we approach the current environment from a position of strength.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/sap-se-on-sap-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q1","e":"sap","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Q1 IFRS operating profit benefited from both lower restructuring expenses, as well as lower share-based compensation expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/sap-se-on-sap-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q2","e":"sap","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Klein","x":"We are streamlining our portfolio, focusing on areas of trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/sap-se-on-sap-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q2","e":"sap","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"In Q2, IFRS operating profit increased by 55% to EUR1.3 billion, benefiting from lower restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/sap-se-on-sap-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q3","e":"sap","d":"2020-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"James Goodman","x":"I mean, I sense within this guidance that you are increasing the emphasis of SAP, owning the customer relationship or providing your own infrastructure, or at least passing through more, within your own contractual terms, the hyperscaler infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q3","e":"sap","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"As expected, we experienced lower restructuring-related payments, and lower income tax payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q3","e":"sap","d":"2020-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Rest assured, that we will continue to drive the Best Run project, streamlining SAP and setting it up for efficiency, simplicity and sustainable long-term success, aiming to come out of the transition of sustainable double-digit operating profit growth from 2023 to 2025 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/26/sap-se-on-sap-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2021-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Stefan Slowinski","x":"Will you also be, I guess, passing through the services revenue from some of the partners or all of the partners through your services line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2021-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"On an IFRS basis, our operating profit and operating margin were positively impacted by significantly lower restructuring charges as well as lower share-based compensation expenses compared to 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2021-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Operating cash flow benefited from lower tax and restructuring payments and a very successful working capital management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2021-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"As a result, operating cash flow for the full year reached EUR7.2 billion, approximately doubling year-over-year and significantly above the raised outlook of around EUR6 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2020 Q4","e":"sap","d":"2021-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Likewise, our free cash flow in 2020 reached EUR6 billion, more than doubling year-over-year and significantly above the raised outlook of about EUR4.5 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/sap-se-on-sap-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2021 Q1","e":"sap","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Both IFRS operating profit and margin were negatively impacted by higher share-based compensation expenses, primarily related to Qualtrics IPO awards, as well as restructuring expenses related to the accelerated harmonization of SAP's cloud delivery infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/sap-se-on-sap-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2021 Q1","e":"sap","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Our operating cash flow increased by 3% to EUR3.1 billion being positively impacted by lower share-based compensation and restructuring payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/sap-se-on-sap-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2021 Q2","e":"sap","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luka Mucic","x":"Positive effects from lower share-based compensation and restructuring payments were compensated by higher income taxes paid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/sap-se-sap-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2021 Q2","e":"sap","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Russell","x":"The customers that we speak to and the momentum that we're making comes from the customer feedback that moving workloads in the cloud to take cost out is not enough.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/sap-se-sap-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAP 2021 Q2","e":"sap","d":"2021-07-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christian Klein","x":"We are optimistic about the future, and 